WEBVTT

00:01:46.565 --> 00:01:47.399
Ouch!

00:01:48.442 --> 00:01:50.319
This isn't something a draking ship does!

00:01:52.362 --> 00:01:53.655
Please don't hit us!

00:01:53.739 --> 00:01:56.325
We're going to get torn to pieces first.

00:01:56.408 --> 00:02:00.787
Will Takita really be able to get
to a place like this?

00:02:01.121 --> 00:02:04.666
We don't have any other leads!
We just have to believe.

00:02:05.000 --> 00:02:07.461
Even so! We can't go on much longer!

00:02:21.141 --> 00:02:22.100
It's time.

00:02:26.605 --> 00:02:27.773
I know!

00:02:30.651 --> 00:02:31.485
Everyone,

00:02:32.361 --> 00:02:34.821
it has been 48 hours.

00:02:35.572 --> 00:02:36.615
Unfortunately,

00:02:37.324 --> 00:02:40.494
we'll be calling off the search.

00:02:47.376 --> 00:02:48.210
Damn it!

00:02:54.549 --> 00:02:56.343
She hasn't eaten that yet.

00:03:04.434 --> 00:03:05.268
What is it?

00:03:06.978 --> 00:03:12.526
Mika! Mika!

00:03:14.152 --> 00:03:15.654
Mika!

00:03:15.737 --> 00:03:18.907
Bridge, head starboard
straight for the pointed rock!

00:03:20.367 --> 00:03:21.618
-Capella!
-Okay!

00:03:21.785 --> 00:03:23.120
Heading starboard!

00:03:24.746 --> 00:03:26.331
Mika!

00:03:26.623 --> 00:03:27.582
Takita.

00:03:27.666 --> 00:03:30.419
Mika!

00:03:32.379 --> 00:03:34.297
-Are you sure?
-Yeah!

00:03:34.631 --> 00:03:36.341
I can hear her voice!

00:03:36.633 --> 00:03:37.884
What do we do?

00:03:38.051 --> 00:03:40.595
We can't hover in this wind!

00:03:40.929 --> 00:03:43.348
Get the right tailplane
as close as you can!

00:03:46.059 --> 00:03:48.270
Vanabelle, take over for me!

00:03:48.645 --> 00:03:50.397
Okay, leave it to me.

00:03:54.234 --> 00:03:55.360
Go in slow.

00:03:56.111 --> 00:03:58.655
Continue descending,
ten degrees to the right!

00:04:03.535 --> 00:04:06.455
Mika!

00:04:07.164 --> 00:04:10.375
Mika!

00:04:10.625 --> 00:04:13.712
Mika!

00:04:14.212 --> 00:04:17.132
Mika!

00:04:17.424 --> 00:04:19.092
Takita, jump!

00:04:23.513 --> 00:04:24.347
Mika!

00:04:39.821 --> 00:04:40.781
Takita.

00:04:41.531 --> 00:04:42.866
I knew you were alive.

00:04:45.660 --> 00:04:46.578
I always said,

00:04:47.329 --> 00:04:48.622
I was at least lucky.

00:04:54.377 --> 00:04:56.171
Takita!

00:04:58.799 --> 00:04:59.925
Aschera!

00:05:00.467 --> 00:05:04.137
Thank you so much for everything!

00:05:04.554 --> 00:05:09.476
I'll always remember you!

00:05:09.684 --> 00:05:13.146
I know we'll see each other again someday!

00:05:22.072 --> 00:05:23.865
So, that's Mika.

00:05:25.283 --> 00:05:29.579
If you're a draker,
don't fall overboard again!

00:05:31.540 --> 00:05:33.917
By the way, what's that on your back?

00:05:36.461 --> 00:05:38.630
It's a baby dragon who fell with me.

00:05:39.464 --> 00:05:40.549
Really?

00:05:41.633 --> 00:05:44.636
I've never eaten a dragon baby before!

00:05:44.719 --> 00:05:45.762
Don't eat her!

00:05:46.972 --> 00:05:48.890
Wipe that drool off your face!

00:05:49.182 --> 00:05:52.769
Gross, the wind is blowing it on me!

00:05:52.853 --> 00:05:54.521
Mika!

00:05:54.771 --> 00:05:55.605
Takita.

00:06:00.610 --> 00:06:01.486
Vannie!

00:06:12.998 --> 00:06:13.915
I'm sorry

00:06:14.791 --> 00:06:15.959
for worrying you.

00:06:22.090 --> 00:06:23.174
I'm glad you're okay.

00:06:23.967 --> 00:06:27.387
It seems like this is where
the migration was headed.

00:06:31.725 --> 00:06:33.476
Vannie, Mika.

00:06:34.102 --> 00:06:36.438
Can you help me without judging me?

00:06:36.813 --> 00:06:38.106
I'm returning her to her herd.

00:06:40.650 --> 00:06:43.028
Are you really Takita?

00:06:45.363 --> 00:06:48.366
Yeah, I know I smell!

00:06:50.118 --> 00:06:51.202
It's the real you.

00:06:52.954 --> 00:06:53.830
Everyone,

00:06:54.164 --> 00:06:55.707
I'm sorry for worrying you all.

00:06:56.166 --> 00:06:57.834
It's me, Takita.

00:06:58.335 --> 00:06:59.544
I'm back!

00:07:02.047 --> 00:07:04.299
-It's her voice!
-Takita!

00:07:04.591 --> 00:07:06.843
Do you have any idea
what you put us through?

00:07:07.093 --> 00:07:09.262
Takita, you're okay!

00:07:09.471 --> 00:07:12.098
I knew you were okay.

00:07:12.515 --> 00:07:14.142
Are you okay? Are you hurt?

00:07:17.896 --> 00:07:19.981
You're always so serious.

00:07:20.523 --> 00:07:22.567
Can't you just forgive her already?

00:07:26.696 --> 00:07:27.530
Yes.

00:07:27.864 --> 00:07:30.075
I'm okay!

00:07:30.367 --> 00:07:31.660
Thank goodness!

00:07:35.747 --> 00:07:37.832
She's not a ghost, is she?

00:07:39.042 --> 00:07:40.043
I swear,

00:07:40.877 --> 00:07:42.712
that girl is trouble!

00:07:44.506 --> 00:07:47.175
That was harder than draking.

00:07:48.134 --> 00:07:49.469
Without a doubt!

00:07:52.889 --> 00:07:54.933
-Thank goodness.
-Thanks.

00:07:56.601 --> 00:07:59.145
I didn't do anything.

00:08:04.901 --> 00:08:05.902
The wind is dying down.

00:08:07.779 --> 00:08:08.780
She'll be left behind!

00:08:09.531 --> 00:08:10.490
What should I do?

00:08:13.618 --> 00:08:14.452
Over there!

00:08:16.997 --> 00:08:18.248
Other dragons!

00:08:19.499 --> 00:08:21.167
The herd is being attacked.

00:08:22.460 --> 00:08:25.463
It's a dragon feeding!
You don't see that every day!

00:08:25.588 --> 00:08:28.425
Takita, tell everyone
to follow those dragons.

00:08:29.009 --> 00:08:30.885
We'll be able to get close
to the herd that way.

00:08:31.761 --> 00:08:35.974
<i>Crocco, other medium-sized dragons</i>
<i>have come to prey on the herd!</i>

00:08:36.266 --> 00:08:37.100
What did you say?

00:08:38.268 --> 00:08:39.102
Oh, my!

00:08:39.352 --> 00:08:40.812
What a rare species!

00:08:41.104 --> 00:08:43.273
It should fetch a high price.

00:08:45.191 --> 00:08:46.401
You want us to do this?

00:08:47.152 --> 00:08:49.112
That's what we came here to do.

00:08:51.156 --> 00:08:53.491
You guys heard him! Let's do this!

00:08:56.494 --> 00:08:59.622
You guys heard him. Takita's back.

00:09:00.040 --> 00:09:01.332
And she brought dragons!

00:09:01.624 --> 00:09:03.585
She always keeps things exciting.

00:09:03.835 --> 00:09:06.337
She's not a dull one, that's for sure.

00:09:06.713 --> 00:09:08.882
Well, I'm exhausted already.

00:09:09.257 --> 00:09:11.634
We'll have to wait
on the touching reunion.

00:09:12.218 --> 00:09:13.887
We'll do this job before the celebration!

00:09:14.262 --> 00:09:15.847
Put your backs into it!

00:09:15.930 --> 00:09:17.348
Get us higher.

00:09:17.515 --> 00:09:19.476
How's it looking in there, engine room?

00:09:19.934 --> 00:09:21.519
What, are you serious?

00:09:21.853 --> 00:09:23.605
We pushed it pretty hard already.

00:09:24.064 --> 00:09:26.983
Besides, I think the hull will give out
before the engine.

00:09:27.358 --> 00:09:28.193
What?

00:09:28.401 --> 00:09:30.236
It's fine as long as
we don't hit anything!

00:09:30.320 --> 00:09:31.196
What?!

00:09:31.571 --> 00:09:33.990
Crocco, I'm the one who has to steer it!

00:09:34.240 --> 00:09:36.701
The oxygen is so thin,
the engine is knocking pretty bad!

00:09:36.993 --> 00:09:39.037
Let's switch up the fuel, then.

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:40.288
Get on it, Hiro!

00:09:41.915 --> 00:09:43.792
Are you kidding me?

00:09:44.584 --> 00:09:46.836
We're entering the clouds!
Everyone be ready!

00:09:47.170 --> 00:09:48.004
Okay!

00:09:48.379 --> 00:09:51.216
-I'll take port side!
-Okay, we'll take starboard!

00:09:51.299 --> 00:09:52.300
Copy that!

00:09:52.634 --> 00:09:54.552
Be careful, it's hard to see in this!

00:09:57.931 --> 00:09:59.557
-Takita!
-Giraud!

00:10:02.102 --> 00:10:04.312
You're hurt, Takita!

00:10:04.562 --> 00:10:05.605
Don't wander around.

00:10:06.523 --> 00:10:09.818
What if you fell overboard again?
Get inside and rest.

00:10:12.737 --> 00:10:13.696
Okay.

00:10:19.494 --> 00:10:21.079
Amazing!

00:10:21.538 --> 00:10:23.790
Dragons are attacking dragons.

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:27.460
-Gibbs.
-Mika.

00:10:27.544 --> 00:10:29.337
It's only focused on the herd.

00:10:29.504 --> 00:10:30.755
Fire the moment it bites.

00:10:31.005 --> 00:10:31.965
I know.

00:10:44.686 --> 00:10:47.772
How many are there?
Where did they come from?

00:10:47.981 --> 00:10:49.899
They're like moths to a flame.

00:10:50.191 --> 00:10:52.694
So, this is the Dragon's Corridor.

00:10:53.361 --> 00:10:55.029
It's this amazing?

00:10:55.405 --> 00:10:56.614
What's going on?

00:10:57.198 --> 00:11:02.203
What's the point of flying around
the world for dragons with this here?

00:11:03.329 --> 00:11:04.164
No.

00:11:04.414 --> 00:11:06.708
A Dragon's Corridor is pretty rare.

00:11:07.125 --> 00:11:08.877
It's only spotted once in a few years.

00:11:09.252 --> 00:11:10.628
It appears very suddenly.

00:11:11.087 --> 00:11:13.256
You can't rely on that.

00:11:13.798 --> 00:11:16.301
Soraya, you should really study more.

00:11:18.636 --> 00:11:21.681
When it spews smoke, the dragons come.

00:11:22.932 --> 00:11:24.851
So, that's what it meant.

00:11:27.020 --> 00:11:29.856
How am I going to get her back
to her herd like this?

00:11:35.904 --> 00:11:37.113
Sorry about this.

00:11:37.363 --> 00:11:38.531
Hey!

00:11:42.702 --> 00:11:47.290
This is just between you and me now!

00:11:50.460 --> 00:11:52.754
Hurry up with the mooring!

00:11:53.838 --> 00:11:56.716
-All done here!
-I'm set, too! Let's get back!

00:11:58.218 --> 00:12:00.136
Over there. Something's coming!

00:12:09.395 --> 00:12:11.356
It's freaking huge!

00:12:11.564 --> 00:12:13.358
I've never seen anything like that before!

00:12:13.566 --> 00:12:16.152
Get the guys mooring back on the ship!

00:12:16.236 --> 00:12:17.278
It's heading our way!

00:12:21.824 --> 00:12:23.493
Get us starboard!

00:12:30.124 --> 00:12:31.709
Awesome!

00:12:31.834 --> 00:12:35.546
It must have come down from
the upper atmosphere for this feast.

00:12:36.339 --> 00:12:38.549
<i>-Bridge!</i>
-I know!

00:12:38.758 --> 00:12:42.428
I'll handle the elevator!
We're getting out of here!

00:12:42.637 --> 00:12:45.056
There's a strong northerly wind.

00:12:45.223 --> 00:12:46.933
I'll circle around them
and ride the stream.

00:12:59.362 --> 00:13:00.196
That...

00:13:01.072 --> 00:13:04.200
It's coming this way.
It rode the same wind.

00:13:05.159 --> 00:13:06.577
Mika, what is it?

00:13:07.036 --> 00:13:09.330
It's a huge dragon I've never seen before.

00:13:09.831 --> 00:13:10.748
I'm going to go get it!

00:13:11.416 --> 00:13:12.500
Mika!

00:13:14.711 --> 00:13:17.839
Is everyone on the ship?
We're falling back!

00:13:17.922 --> 00:13:20.049
Let's get out of here!

00:13:21.009 --> 00:13:22.552
-Takita.
-Vannie?

00:13:22.969 --> 00:13:24.304
If you're a draker,

00:13:25.763 --> 00:13:28.766
then you need to do what you need to do.

00:13:30.226 --> 00:13:32.854
-What about you?
-I can't watch the idiot kill himself.

00:13:35.440 --> 00:13:38.151
What is he doing? Wait!

00:13:39.485 --> 00:13:40.320
Come with me.

00:13:43.823 --> 00:13:46.868
Damn it, this day has been awful.

00:13:47.785 --> 00:13:49.579
Hiro! I've been looking for you!

00:13:50.621 --> 00:13:52.498
Can the gyrocopter fly?

00:13:54.125 --> 00:13:55.960
What do you need that for?

00:13:57.712 --> 00:13:58.546
Please!

00:14:02.342 --> 00:14:04.802
But...

00:14:06.012 --> 00:14:09.223
I have to take her home.

00:14:16.814 --> 00:14:19.359
I'll put in fuel for high altitude.

00:14:20.443 --> 00:14:22.070
But don't blame me with what--

00:14:23.071 --> 00:14:25.448
What are you two doing?
It's dangerous out here!

00:14:35.625 --> 00:14:37.919
Are you two sure about this?

00:14:38.252 --> 00:14:39.545
Yes, we'll be okay.

00:14:40.004 --> 00:14:42.215
No, we're not going to be okay!

00:14:42.548 --> 00:14:46.260
Why are you always causing trouble?

00:14:47.303 --> 00:14:50.681
It's a little finicky,
so you have to rev it up!

00:14:51.557 --> 00:14:53.059
Okay.

00:14:53.142 --> 00:14:55.770
Promise not to drop her!

00:14:57.772 --> 00:14:58.606
You got it.

00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:02.193
Go!

00:15:04.112 --> 00:15:06.864
Hey, don't shake us so much!

00:15:08.866 --> 00:15:11.953
Now then, back to work.

00:15:12.412 --> 00:15:14.539
Hey, what's that?

00:15:16.332 --> 00:15:18.042
What the hell are they doing?!

00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:24.006
Giraud, over there.

00:15:24.298 --> 00:15:27.093
Damn it, how did you talk me into this?

00:15:43.734 --> 00:15:44.569
Vanabelle!

00:15:45.153 --> 00:15:46.571
What are you doing?!

00:15:49.031 --> 00:15:50.324
We're hunting this, right?

00:15:51.993 --> 00:15:54.370
Yeah, it looks delicious.

00:16:09.802 --> 00:16:12.138
Takita, why are you doing this?

00:16:12.722 --> 00:16:16.142
Because I'm a draker.

00:16:16.309 --> 00:16:17.185
What?

00:16:18.269 --> 00:16:21.564
I killed and ate her mother.

00:16:21.731 --> 00:16:23.107
You're a draker.

00:16:23.316 --> 00:16:25.860
-That comes with the territory.
-Yes.

00:16:27.320 --> 00:16:30.531
We're drakers and they're dragons.

00:16:30.615 --> 00:16:31.949
-What?
-That's why.

00:16:32.617 --> 00:16:36.037
I need to return her
so she can grow up big and strong.

00:16:36.829 --> 00:16:38.331
Big and strong?

00:16:39.499 --> 00:16:41.459
What are you talking about?

00:16:42.585 --> 00:16:43.628
I don't get it.

00:16:45.254 --> 00:16:46.088
I want...

00:16:47.507 --> 00:16:48.966
to live in the sky, too.

00:16:59.393 --> 00:17:01.979
I think I get it now.

00:17:14.659 --> 00:17:17.703
I mean, he told me
to pack it with explosives.

00:17:17.787 --> 00:17:20.206
-That's way overboard.
-That was awesome!

00:17:33.427 --> 00:17:34.428
Niko!

00:17:36.305 --> 00:17:38.182
That was a close one.

00:17:39.100 --> 00:17:40.518
Now we're even.

00:17:41.936 --> 00:17:43.854
Takita, go!

00:17:51.612 --> 00:17:53.573
The next time we meet,

00:17:54.532 --> 00:17:56.200
I'll be coming to hunt you.

00:17:57.827 --> 00:17:59.453
Because I'm a draker.

00:18:02.623 --> 00:18:04.834
So, until then,

00:18:05.751 --> 00:18:07.545
don't get eaten by anyone else.

00:18:08.879 --> 00:18:09.714
It'll be okay.

00:18:13.801 --> 00:18:14.635
Let's go.

00:19:22.662 --> 00:19:23.788
Takita, Giraud!

00:19:24.205 --> 00:19:26.082
What the hell were you doing?!

00:19:27.208 --> 00:19:28.292
Hiro! You, too!

00:19:30.670 --> 00:19:31.504
Mika, too!

00:19:32.046 --> 00:19:37.218
-You're always causing trouble!
-I let it get away.

00:19:44.058 --> 00:19:45.017
It's dawn.

00:19:46.936 --> 00:19:49.897
We lost sight of them.

00:19:50.606 --> 00:19:51.440
Yeah.

00:19:53.442 --> 00:19:54.276
Mika.

00:19:55.611 --> 00:19:59.156
The sky is really big and vast.

00:20:05.079 --> 00:20:08.958
Looks like everyone's okay!
You must be hungry.

00:20:09.208 --> 00:20:11.377
I'll whip up some breakfast for you.

00:20:12.545 --> 00:20:14.714
I want steak!

00:20:16.173 --> 00:20:17.425
It's still morning.

00:20:17.758 --> 00:20:20.469
We were up all night.
Call it a late dinner.

00:20:20.594 --> 00:20:22.012
So, that means booze, too?

00:20:22.346 --> 00:20:24.306
Since Takita is now back, too,

00:20:24.557 --> 00:20:26.767
let's celebrate!

00:20:27.184 --> 00:20:32.148
I should've at least
taken a bite out of it.

00:20:32.440 --> 00:20:33.274
Hey.

00:20:36.485 --> 00:20:38.988
Don't laugh at me! Honestly!

00:20:41.240 --> 00:20:43.617
<i>Traveling east and west,</i>

00:20:43.993 --> 00:20:47.079
<i>to the south and to the north</i>
<i>in pursuit of the dragons.</i>

00:20:48.289 --> 00:20:51.125
<i>They ride the wind</i>
<i>and continue their journey</i>

00:20:52.376 --> 00:20:54.503
<i>following the shadows.</i>

00:20:55.755 --> 00:20:57.631
-Takita, explosives!
-Coming!

00:20:58.007 --> 00:21:01.469
Takita, what are you doing?
Bring me a bomb lance already!

00:21:01.552 --> 00:21:02.386
Okay!

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:09.143
"Looks good,"

00:21:09.643 --> 00:21:10.478
right?

00:21:11.729 --> 00:21:12.563
Yeah.

00:21:13.814 --> 00:21:14.815
Be careful out there!

00:21:19.195 --> 00:21:21.572
Takita, get over here already.

00:21:21.864 --> 00:21:22.865
Coming!

00:22:59.461 --> 00:23:01.964
Subtitle translation by Zensho Yamamoto
